## (6) Dependent Components and their codes
# DCNL: Name list of Dependent Components (<=16 characters per name) [nDC]
<DCNL>
'Na+' 'Cl-' 'OH-' 'H+' 'H2O@' 
# ccDC: Class codes of DCs (Dependent Components) [nDC]
<ccDC>
